      <span class="content-split__eyebrow">The Process</span>
      <h2 class="content-split__heading">How It Works</h2>
      <p class="content-split__text">Modeled after Old Bill's Fun Run, the Tin Cup Challenge is designed to maximize collaborative community impact. The annual campaign strengthens the tremendous work of Teton Valley's nonprofits, encourages everyone to give, and fosters the spirit of generosity.</p>
      <ul class="content-split__list">
        <li>Challengers pledge a matching gift during the Giving Period</li>
        <li>Community members donate to participating nonprofits</li>
        <li>Challenger funds match donations to amplify every gift</li>
        <li>Culminates in the Tin Cup Challenge Fun Run — always the 3rd Saturday in July</li>
      </ul>
